---
# Project convention: role variables use a shared `soe_<role>_` prefix
# (e.g. soe_timesync_pools) rather than ansible-lint's default
# `<role>_` prefix expectation, so it's obvious at a glance that a
# variable is managed by this SOE project across all its roles. This is
# a deliberate, documented choice (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), not an
# oversight — hence the skip below instead of a rename.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
